        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959950/extras/82bd13be775e867ab61eab2e5d0e5ef6.poster.avif?t=1781418696\" aria-label=\"Showcase of the panel mechanic\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959950/extras/82bd13be775e867ab61eab2e5d0e5ef6.webm?t=1781418696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959950/extras/82bd13be775e867ab61eab2e5d0e5ef6.mp4?t=1781418696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhombus is a first-person puzzle game where you build your path through panels controlling platforms. Explore and find your way through a compact environment in this small metroidbrainia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique puzzle mechanic that plays with perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact 'open-world' environment with multiple paths &amp; non-linear exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated length of 2-3 hours - perfect for a single evening/afternoon</p></li></ul>",
